  "_comment": [
    "The corpus is pinned, never vendored. Each entry names a repository and an",
    "exact commit; eval/fetch.py clones them into eval/.work/, which is ignored.",
    "Nine of these carry no licence at all, which makes redistribution not ours",
    "to do -- and a frozen copy would stop being an unseen repository within a",
    "few months anyway, which is the whole property being bought here."
